# Unity 2022.3 Project Rules - TEngine Framework

## Project Overview

This project uses **TEngine Framework** - a modular Unity framework solution with hot-update support, built on Unity 2022.3 LTS.

## Tech Stack

- **Unity Version**: 2022.3 LTS
- **C# Version**: 9.0
- **Framework**: TEngine (Modular Architecture)
- **Rendering Pipeline**: URP (Universal Render Pipeline)
- **Input System**: New Input System (InputSystem package) + Input Manager
- **UI Framework**: UGUI (runtime) + UI Toolkit (editor tools)
- **Asset Management**: YooAsset (replaces Resources)
- **Hot Update**: HybridCLR (full-platform native C# hot update)
- **Async Programming**: UniTask (replaces Coroutines)
- **Localization**: I2Localization
- **Testing**: Unity Test Framework

